msgid ""
"What `./run.sh` does: activate the env (and source `[ros2].workspace` if "
"set), then the README menu: viser, VR (Vuer / XRoboToolkit), VR bag "
"record/playback, interface joint record/playback, versions."
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 做什么：激活环境（若配置了 `[ros2].workspace` 会 source），然后是 README "
"菜单：viser、VR（Vuer / XRoboToolkit）、VR bag 录放、interface 关节录放、版本号。"

