#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:54
#: b628730f99cf449d9b89d2431fa80293
msgid ""
"Headset SKU notes live on [VR "
"Teleop](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md): Pico "
"**Enterprise** supports USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) and uses a "
"**different App** from Pico **consumer**. This page only lists fa-py-"
"libraries README commands (`./run.sh vr` vs `./run.sh vr-xrt` + PC "
"Service). It does not name store listings, package names, or ADB steps."
msgstr ""
"头显 SKU 说明见 [VR 遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)：Pico **企业版** 支持 USB 网络共享，并使用与 Pico **消费版** 不同的 App。本页只列出 fa-py-libraries README 命令（`./run.sh vr` 对比 `./run.sh vr-xrt` + PC Service）。不给出商店条目、软件包名或 ADB 步骤。"

